  "STR-2418": "가이드 장면 '${…}' 이(가) 없습니다.",
  "STR-2531": "- **Do not send a bare acknowledgement** (\"받았습니다\", \"on it\"). The app already marks the user's message 📨 delivered → ⚙️ working → ✅ done from the harness itself, so a receipt message only costs a turn. Send content, not confirmation.",
  "STR-2532": "- The user can also drive the app from Discord with `!` commands (`!상태`, `!연결`, `!중단`, `!재시작`). Those are handled by the app, never by you — you will not see them.",
